<title>USA: Walker Wingsail eyes private placement.</title>
<headline>Walker Wingsail eyes private placement.</headline>
<dateline>NORTH ANDOVER, Mass. 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Walker Wingsail America Inc said on Wednesday that it was considering issuing up to two million restricted common shares via a private placement.</p>
<p>If issued, the restricted Rule &quot;144&quot; stock would be sold by the company to accredited investors, it said.</p>
<p>Walker Wingsail America has exclusive North and South American manufacturing and marketing rights from Walker Wingsail Systems PLC of England, which designs, builds and markets advanced cruising yachts.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
